  "title": "Battle of Chaldiran",
  "summary": "On 23 August 1514 the Ottoman army under Sultan Selim I destroyed the Safavid forces of Shah Ismail I at Chaldiran, on a plain between Khoi and Urmia north-west of Tabriz. The Ottomans took Tabriz on 5 September but left about eight days later. The Safavids afterwards moved their capital from Tabriz to Qazwin.",
